{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","id":"9b9c401e-f91c-4526-9d64-19e03a8431b7","timestamp":"2026-10-31T07:21:16.099Z","version":"2.1.309","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"7b35af0d1ba22d1b1b7d4c91038d50b583ea5d544dd1607adac5368903cb8a35","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"max"}},"base":"3dac358b-b812-497c-937d-4176f8a71f38","keep":310,"tail":["c611229990065c4a16c7213ffa9dbcecc23cc79c10b7338dec0bb36e8f618e96","b0e3cbaa3b8a2b90cf94614a59ba0ee987e7ce05a88feb45b2a1088f0060f846"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",311,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"4d0b44cff9b881297b95fdfcd988feb35b22aca145de3086de0c0ad31ee89a67"}
{"parentUuid":"e27e8187-05bc-458d-9363-c313bd9e4769","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgZuoHk8HWVVdreLiVSmH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2C.1: GATE PASSED\n\nPushed to `phase-2c-reader` at `fc26372`; `ls-remote` shows the same commit. There's no PR, and nothing has been labelled for gold.\n\n- **Draw** (`984ae90`, after `POLICY.md` at `6cd57e2`): 300 gold and 150 dev articles in 17 strata. Each article's inclusion weight is in `split.json`, and `HASH` matches it.\n- **Leakage:** `check_leakage.py` exits 0. Its rule is at least 5 shared five-word runs, making up 10% of the shorter text. It flags all 603 one-story pairs in decision 36's randomly drawn strata. It also set aside 1,196 pool articles the grouping missed, mostly short repeated adverts and columns.\n- **Expected reports in gold:** about 35 at the judged rates, before E8 and E6, which no judged item measures. At 35 reports, a field right in 30 of them has an interval of 71–94%.\n- **Dev:** I label it by hand under `POLICY.md` in 2C.2.\n- **Labelling page** (`scripts/label_gold.py`): runs locally, crops come through `crops_for`, and one real article loaded correctly.\n- 365 tests pass and lint is clean.\n\nOpen: say if the teacher should label dev instead of me. Full details are in [step-2C.1.md](/Users/hotragn/Library/Application%20Support/Claude/side-session-notes/local_98906164-c8d6-46c4-b1d0-192cf333434e/step-2C.1.md).\n\nNot done: the page doesn't highlight lexicon matches; finding text in the page works instead."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2028,"cache_read_input_tokens":388487,"output_tokens":563,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2028,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":563,"cache_read_input_tokens":388487,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2028,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2028},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1ca14364-45ab-44a8-a2b0-5b18d5e5d821","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgZuoGsXe29B5ZJEa9GwJ","requestRef":"9b9c401e-f91c-4526-9d64-19e03a8431b7","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"fab183da-293b-4732-a099-ea6cdae1225f","timestamp":"2026-10-31T07:21:22.274Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2c-reader","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
